Description: calculator for Linux Mint and the Cinnamon desktop
 Xcalculator is a calculator in the style of the Linux Mint X-Apps, with a
 classic menubar, the system theme and a history you can click to reuse
 earlier answers.
 .
 It has Basic, Scientific, Financial, Programmer and Unit Converter modes,
 works to up to 50 decimal places, and can print its history like an
 adding-machine tape.
